---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Human" noindex={true} human>
  <main class="void-text">
    <h1 class="visually-hidden">Human</h1>
    <p>Content beyond this point was written without a filter. It may cause discomfort. It may break something you assumed about the person behind it.</p>
    <p>The author is not seeking advice. These are not invitations for correction.</p>
    <p>What is welcomed is curiosity. The willingness to sit with discomfort rather than resolve it. To ask why something exists, not how to remove it.</p>
    <p>No one here stands higher than anyone else.</p>
    <p>There is no going back to not knowing.</p>
    <form action="/human/all" method="get"><button class="btn95">I totally understand.</button></form>
  </main>
</Base>
